sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Panel
  participant A as Agent (old)
  participant D as Docker Engine
  participant U as Updater (temporary)
  participant N as Agent (new)

  P->>A: agent.update<br/>(images pinned by digest)
  A->>D: pull both images by digest
  A->>D: run updater (auto-remove,<br/>docker.sock + agent volume)
  A-->>P: progress: updater started
  U->>D: inspect pocketcloud-agent
  U->>D: stop old container, rename it
  U->>D: create new container<br/>(same config, new image)
  D->>N: start
  N->>P: reconnect with the new version
  U->>D: wait until the new<br/>container is healthy
  alt healthy before the timeout
    U->>D: remove old container
  else unhealthy or timeout
    U->>D: remove new container,<br/>rename and start the old one
  end
  U->>U: write the result to<br/>the agent volume, exit
  Note over P,N: whichever agent runs afterwards reports the result for the command id
